#. でも、今回は<CLT 3>２つの事件<CLT>が起きてたんだ…
#. だったら、共犯関係も成り立つんじゃないかな？
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Since there were <CLT 3>two murders<CLT>, it's at least\n"
"plausible that more than one person was involved."
msgstr "Không, chắc chắn là có liên quan đấy!"
#. …どういう意味だ？
msgctxt "0002 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "...What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#. 共犯者の存在が考えられないのは、
#. 起きた事件が、１つだった場合の話よ。
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If there'd only been one murder, then yes, the idea of\n"
"an accomplice isn't really worth considering."
msgstr ""

#. 当然よね。１つの事件で助かるのが１人だけなら、
#. 共犯したところで、<CLT 3>天秤作用<CLT>が成立しないんだから…
msgctxt "0004 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Naturally, if only one person can be saved per murder,\n"
"an accomplice has no <CLT 3>risk versus reward<CLT> benefit."
msgstr ""

#. …天秤作用？
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Risk versus reward...benefit?"
msgstr "Không chỉ có vậy đâu. Cả <CLT 3>địa điểm tập hợp<CLT> ghi trên mẩu ghi chú này nữa..."
#. その仕事と釣り合う額の報酬…
#. つまり、共犯するだけの危険に見合った報酬…
msgctxt "0006 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The payoff for working together—the reward that\n"
"balances out the risk of taking part in the scheme."
msgstr ""

#. 殺人を手伝っても助からないんだったら、
#. 共犯する意味なんてない…
msgctxt "0007 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"There's no point in being someone's accomplice if\n"
"there's no benefit to you."
msgstr ""

#. でも逆に、その天秤作用さえ成立すれば、
#. 誰かと共犯関係になる事は不可能ではないわ…
msgctxt "0008 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"However, if there *were* some potential mutual reward\n"
"for the risk, then cooperation becomes possible."
msgstr ""

#. ２人の犯人が２つの殺人を犯し、
#. 互いの殺人の共犯者になればいい…という事か。
msgctxt "0009 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"You're saying that two people could act as each\n"
"other's accomplices to commit two separate murders."
msgstr ""

#. 真犯人は、その計画を山田君に持ちかけたのよ。
#. 自分の犯行の共犯をさせる為にね…
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I think that's what the true killer told Hifumi; they\n"
"would each have an accomplice for their crime."
msgstr ""

#. おそらく、最初に石丸君を殺したのは、
#. 山田君だったはずよ…
msgctxt "0011 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"And based on the case's events, Hifumi would have been\n"
"the first one to act, murdering Taka."
msgstr ""

#. 先に、彼に殺人を起こさせ、逃げられなくした上で、
#. 自分の計画を手伝わせたんでしょうね…
msgctxt "0012 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"They made him carry out the first murder so he\n"
"couldn't back out of helping them later on."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、今回の事件は１人の犯人による
#. 連続殺人なんかじゃなくって…
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So in this case, there wasn't one single person\n"
"committing multiple murders..."
msgstr ""

#. ２人の犯人が起こした、２つの事件だったんだよ。
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Instead, each person killed someone, creating two\n"
"separate incidents."
msgstr ""

#. それが一連の連続殺人に見えたのは、
#. すべて、犯人の偽装工作によるものだったんだ…
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And it only looked like one person because that's how\n"
"the true killer designed it to look."
msgstr ""

#. 顔を隠した不審者…似たような凶器…そして死体消失…
#. 犯人は、これらの共通点を作り上げる事で…
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"A single suspicious individual, a similar weapon used\n"
"in each crime, disappearing bodies..."
msgstr "Chuyện đó... chắc chắn là do Hifumi đã tước đoạt nó từ thi thể của Taka sau khi cậu ấy chết rồi..."
#. 一連の犯行が同一犯によって行われていると、
#. 見せかけようとしたんだ！
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"By creating one seamless set of circumstances, they\n"
"made it look like one person was behind it all!"
msgstr ""

#. 犯人はその計画を共犯者に持ちかけ、
#. そして、共犯者を得る事に成功し…
msgctxt "0018 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"The mastermind picked their target and managed to\n"
"convince him to go along with their plan."
msgstr "Bằng chứng cho việc đó là gì? Cậu chỉ ra xem nào."
#. 最後に、その共犯者を殺す事で、
#. １番の懸念材料をも消し去ったという訳か。
msgctxt "0019 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"And then, to avoid the \"no accomplices\" rule, they\n"
"simply...killed their accomplice."
msgstr "Này, cậu đang đùa giỡn đấy à? Đó là thứ nằm trên người cậu ta, tôi không phủ nhận điều đó."
#. となると、山田を裏切ったのも、
#. 当初からの計画通りだったんだろうな…
msgctxt "0020 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Which, if true, means that betraying Hifumi was part\n"
"of the plan from the very beginning."
msgstr "Thứ tôi đang yêu cầu là bằng chứng cho thấy cậu ta đã *cướp* nó cơ."
#. な、なんなの…その計画って！
#. いくらなんでも残酷すぎるよ！！
msgctxt "0021 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Th-That's just...awful! How could anyone be so cruel!?"
msgstr "Cái đó mà là bằng chứng hả? Sao lại thế ông?"
#. そうか？　なかなかよく出来た計画じゃないか。
#. 共犯者の人選は別だがな…
msgctxt "0022 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"You think so? I can't help but admire its cunning.\n"
"Still, their choice of accomplice seems...odd."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>連続殺人に見せかけた２つの事件…
#. それが今回の事件の最大の特徴だったんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The effort made to convince us the two murders were\n"
"the same. That was the main characteristic this time.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>きっと、霧切さんは最初から、
#. その事実に気付いてたんだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko must have noticed that fact from the very\n"
"beginning...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だから、今回の事件を一連の事件としてじゃなく、
#. それぞれ別の事件として考えるべきだって言ったんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Which is why she said not to look at this as a series\n"
"of connected events, but entirely separate incidents.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như ấn tượng của mọi người dành cho mình vừa tệ đi rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"
#. <CLT 4>霧切さん…すごいけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko really is amazing. Although...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いくらなんでも…すご過ぎだろ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...when you think about it, she's almost *too*\n"
"amazing.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…なんだか不自然なくらいだよ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Like, it's almost unnatural how good she is at this...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như ấn tượng của mọi người dành cho mình vừa tệ đi rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"
#. 共犯者の存在が成り立つ事はわかったが…
#. では、山田を操っていた真犯人とは何者なのだ？
msgctxt "0029 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I understand how an accomplice could be involved, but\n"
"then who was the one pulling Hifumi's strings?"
msgstr ""

#. それが問題だな！！
msgctxt "0030 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "That's problem numero uno right now!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>真犯人…山田クンを操る事で一連の事件を実行し、
#. そして最終的には山田君を殺した犯人…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The true killer manipulated Hifumi to carry out a\n"
"number of actions, and in the end...murdered him.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr "Nếu suy luận của tớ không lầm, thì <CLT 3>vết rách<CLT> của mảnh giấy này sẽ..."
#. <CLT 4>今までの議論…事件の流れ…
#. それらすべてを踏まえて考えてみれば…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In the debates up till now, the way the case has\n"
"unfolded... When you consider all that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr "Đúng như tớ nghĩ! Nó hoàn toàn <CLT 3>trùng khớp<CLT> với mẩu giấy ghi chú mà Hifumi đã giấu trong người."
#. <CLT 4>その可能性がありそうなのって、
#. あの人しかいないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...there's really only one person who seems to fit.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はあッ！？
#. こ、ここで俺に戻ってくるんか？
msgctxt "0034 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "What!? I-Is it all coming back to me again!?"
msgstr ""

#. 待て…
msgctxt "0035 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Hold on..."
msgstr ""

#. 葉隠に犯行が不可能な事は
#. これまでの議論で、逆に証明されたのではないか？
msgctxt "0036 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Haven't we already shown that there's absolutely no\n"
"way Hiro could have done this?"
msgstr ""

#. そうだよね。
#. 事件の間、葉隠はロボになってたんだもんね。
msgctxt "0037 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"She's right! Hiro was in the robot costume when\n"
"everything went down!"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そうだべ！
msgctxt "0038 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "F-For serious!"
msgstr ""

#. 俺は改造された悲劇のヒーローで
#. 早く人間になりたいんだベ！
msgctxt "0039 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I'm just a tragically modified hero, who longs to\n"
"become human again as soon as possible!"
msgstr ""

#. いや、今でも人間でしょ…一応。
msgctxt "0040 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Um, no... You're still a human...for now."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>と、とにかく…
#. 葉隠クンは真犯人じゃないって事か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A-Anyway...if Hiro's not the killer, then...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 私…？
msgctxt "0043 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Me...?"
msgstr ""

#. どういった根拠でそう言うのか…
#. 教えてもらいましょうか？
msgctxt "0044 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"What are you basing that on? I would very much like to\n"
"hear your explanation."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いくらなんでも…すご過ぎだから…
#. なんて、根拠にもならないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Um...hmm... I guess when you put it that way, I don't\n"
"really have an explanation...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 根拠はないようね…
#. じゃあ、今度こそ真犯人を指摘してくれる？
msgctxt "0046 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"You have no basis for your claim, in other words. So\n"
"then, could you point out the *real* killer?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr "Hifumi mà tụi mình nhìn thấy ở kho mỹ thuật chắc chắn là đã chết rồi."
#. 本当に、自信を持ってそう言うのか？
msgctxt "0048 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Are you confident in your assertion?"
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. もう一度、冷静に考えてみた方が
#. いいんじゃないかしら？
msgctxt "0050 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Perhaps you should take a second and think it through\n"
"again—more slowly this time."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木、黙っていても議論は進まん…
msgctxt "0052 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "The case can't advance through your silence, Makoto."
msgstr ""

#. 残念ながら、時間は
#. お前のような輩にも平等に流れるからな…
msgctxt "0053 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, time moves just as quickly even for\n"
"people like you."
msgstr "Trong suốt khoảng thời gian đó, chúng ta đang chia nhau ra để truy tìm cái xác bị biến mất."
#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>セレスさん<CLT>……
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It was <CLT 3>Celeste<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. あら…わたくしが怪しいのですか？
msgctxt "0056 | CELES"
msgid "Ah, so I'm the suspicious individual now, am I?"
msgstr ""

#. うふふ、嫌ですわ。そんなご冗談を…
msgctxt "0057 | CELES"
msgid "Hmhmhm. I really do hate this kind of joke..."
msgstr ""

#. 冗談…それはどうかな？
msgctxt "0058 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "A joke? I wonder..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0059 | CELES"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …では、わたくしと山田君が組んでいたと、
#. おっしゃるのですね。
msgctxt "0060 | CELES"
msgid ""
"So what you are saying, then, is that I specifically\n"
"chose to work together with Hifumi."
msgstr ""

#. そんな…わたくしと山田君が組んでいたなんて…
msgctxt "0061 | CELES"
msgid ""
"The idea that I would choose to spend any amount of\n"
"time interacting with him..."
msgstr ""

#. そんな事ある訳ねぇだろう、クソボケがッ！！
#. 誰があんなヘタレと組むっつーんだよ！！
msgctxt "0062 | CELES"
msgid ""
"That I would go within ten feet of that\n"
"shit-for-brains! That lazy, worthless goddamn idiot!"
msgstr ""

#. …うふ、失礼しましたわ。
msgctxt "0063 | CELES"
msgid "Ahem. Ah, pardonnez-moi."
msgstr ""

#. 言っておくが、根拠もあるぞ。
msgctxt "0064 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Just to be clear, there *is* evidence to support it."
msgstr ""

#. …根拠？
msgctxt "0065 | CELES"
msgid "...Is that so?"
msgstr ""

#. そうだ。今回の一連の事件において、
#. お前らだけは共通して<CLT 3>“ある行動”<CLT>を取っていた…
msgctxt "0066 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It is. Throughout the investigation, there was\n"
"<CLT 3>certain behavior<CLT> that was common only to the two of you."
msgstr ""

#. それが根拠になるんだよ。
#. お前らが組んでいた事のな！
msgctxt "0067 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Considering what we've learned so far, it only further\n"
"proves that the two of you were working together!"
msgstr ""

#. 不審者の目撃
msgctxt "0068 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Encountering the suspicious individual"
msgstr ""

#. パンツに紙の切れ端を隠していた
msgctxt "0069 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The paper hidden in Hifumi's pants"
msgstr ""

#. まだパンツの話をしているの…？
#. まじめに考えて。
msgctxt "0070 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Why is everyone obsessed with Hifumi's pants? Please\n"
"take this a little more seriously..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まずい事を言ってしまったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Bad call on my part, I guess.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 大声で叫んだ
msgctxt "0073 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The screaming"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確かに、２人共が大声で叫んでるけど…
#. それは今は関係なさそうだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, it's true that both of them did a lot of\n"
"screaming. But I don't think that's it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. どうした…？
#. 何か言いたい事でもあるのか？
msgctxt "0076 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "What's wrong? Do you have something you want to say?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>共通して取っていた行動…
#. まさに不審な…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Behavior that they had in common... There's definitely\n"
"something suspicious there...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr "Mấy cây búa đó cũng bị bỏ lại ở các phòng khác rồi, vả lại ngay từ đầu kích thước của chúng có vẻ không đủ để lấy mạng một người đâu..."
#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0078 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>山田クンとセレスさんだけが共通して取っていた行動…
#. それって、ひょっとして…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What it is that only Hifumi and Celeste had in\n"
"common...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 山田クンとセレスさんだけが共通して取っていた行動…
#. それって、<CLT 3>不審者の目撃<CLT>の事だよね？
msgctxt "0080 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The behavior they had in common has to do with the\n"
"\"<CLT 3>suspicious individual<CLT>\" in the suit, doesn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. 例の不審者…ジャスティスロボを目撃してるのって、
#. セレスさんと山田クンだけだったもんね。
msgctxt "0081 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The only ones who ever actually saw Robo Justice\n"
"firsthand were Celeste and Hifumi."
msgstr ""

#. でしゃばるな…
msgctxt "0082 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Shush. The adults are talking now."
msgstr ""

#. ご、ごめん…
msgctxt "0083 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "S-Sorry..."
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Nếu không làm sáng tỏ được điều này, chúng ta sẽ không bao giờ nhìn thấy bức tranh toàn cảnh của tội ác...\n"
"<CLT>"
#. 苗木の言う通り、例の不審者を目撃しているのは、
#. 山田とセレスの２人だけだった…
msgctxt "0084 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"As he said, only Celeste and Hifumi ever laid eyes on\n"
"the costumed individual."
msgstr ""

#. その山田が犯人の１人であれば、
#. もう一方のセレスの証言も、怪しいと見るのが当然だ。
msgctxt "0085 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If we accept that Hifumi was one of the culprits, we\n"
"can't help but suspect what Celeste has said, as well."
msgstr ""

#. すべてウソ…って事？
msgctxt "0086 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Are you saying everything they told us was a lie...?"
msgstr ""

#. 図書室でケガをした山田を保健室に連れて行った後、
#. 俺達は全員で、不審者の捜索を始めたな？
msgctxt "0087 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"After taking Hifumi to the nurse's office, we all\n"
"began our search for this individual, correct?"
msgstr ""

#. その直後の…セレスの言葉を思い出してみろ。
msgctxt "0088 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"And not too long after that, do you remember what\n"
"Celeste said?"
msgstr ""

#. 影です…あの階段の上で影が動きました！
msgctxt "0089 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I saw a shadow! Something moving around at the top of\n"
"the stairs!"
msgstr ""

#. あの証言があったからこそ、
#. 俺達は２階へと移動したんだ。
msgctxt "0090 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"We headed to the 2nd floor specifically because of\n"
"what she claimed to have seen."
msgstr ""

#. そこで、セレスは
#. 俺達を３階の物理室へと誘導する為に…
msgctxt "0091 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Next, to draw us all to the physics lab, up on the 3rd\n"
"floor..."
msgstr ""

#. ３階で悲鳴を上げた…
msgctxt "0092 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "...She let out a bloodcurdling scream."
msgstr ""

#. あの時、悲鳴を聞き付けて３階に集まった俺達に、
#. セレスはなんと言った？
msgctxt "0093 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"And when we'd all come to see what was wrong, what was\n"
"it she said?"
msgstr ""

#. セレスちゃん、どうしたの！？
msgctxt "0094 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Celeste! What's wrong!?"
msgstr ""

#. お前にしては、やけに大げさな叫び声だったな…
msgctxt "0095 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"That was a rather...intense scream for someone like\n"
"you."
msgstr ""

#. 見つけたのです…例のコスプレ不審者を…
msgctxt "0096 | CELES"
msgid "I saw him! The strange costumed man...!"
msgstr ""

#. わたくしが叫び声を上げたら、
#. 逃げていきました。
msgctxt "0097 | CELES"
msgid "He ran off as soon as I screamed..."
msgstr ""

#. 階段を背にしたわたくしに対して、
#. 左側の廊下の奥を曲がっていきましたわ。
msgctxt "0098 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I was blocking the stairs, so he headed further down\n"
"into the hallway and disappeared...!"
msgstr ""

#. そうやって、俺達を物理室に向かうよう仕向けた後は…
msgctxt "0099 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Once she'd done her job of getting us all up to the\n"
"physics lab..."
msgstr ""

#. …もう１人の相方の出番だ。
msgctxt "0100 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "...it was time for her partner to get to work."
msgstr ""

#. ギニャアアアアアアアーッ！！
msgctxt "0101 | NO NAME"
msgid "Ungyaaaaaahhh!!!"
msgstr ""

#. …えっ！？
msgctxt "0102 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh!?"
msgstr ""

#. な、何ッ…！？
msgctxt "0103 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Wh-What was that!?"
msgstr ""

#. 下の階から聞えましたわね。
#. という事は、今の悲鳴は…！
msgctxt "0104 | CELES"
msgid "That came from downstairs! It must have been..."
msgstr ""

#. 保健室にいる…山田クンの…？
msgctxt "0105 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hifumi! He's in the nurse's office!"
msgstr ""

#. マズイよ！　急いで戻ろう！！
msgctxt "0106 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "This is bad! Come on, we have to go back!"
msgstr ""

#. あれは…私達を二手に分かれさせて…
#. 同時に死体を発見させる為に…！？
msgctxt "0107 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"It was to get us to divide into two groups...so that\n"
"we would discover both bodies at the same time!?"
msgstr ""

#. 現に、二手に分かれようと提案したのも、
#. セレスだったはずだ。
msgctxt "0108 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"In fact, Celeste was precisely the one who proposed\n"
"that we split up."
msgstr ""

#. でしたら、二手に分かれましょうか。
msgctxt "0109 | CELES"
msgid "Then why don't we split into two groups?"
msgstr ""

#. 俺は捕獲の方に回るぞ。その方が面白そうだ。
msgctxt "0110 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I'll lead the hunting party. That seems much more\n"
"interesting."
msgstr ""

#. では、苗木君と朝日奈さんは、
#. わたくしと共に保健室へ…
msgctxt "0111 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Very well, then Makoto and Hina, you come with me to\n"
"the nurse's office."
msgstr ""

#. 腐川さんと十神君と大神さんは、
#. 不審者の捕獲をお願いしますわ。
msgctxt "0112 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I will leave the capture of the suspicious individual\n"
"to Toko, Byakuya, and Sakura."
msgstr ""

#. どうだ？　セレスと山田が組んでいると仮定した途端、
#. すべての偶然が、故意の必然へと繋がっていくんだ…
msgctxt "0113 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Well? If Celeste and Hifumi were working together, all\n"
"those chance events suddenly become connected..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0114 | CELES"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 付け加えて言えば、
#. その前の、お前の盛大な叫び声…
msgctxt "0115 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"And on top of that...that piercing cry of yours early\n"
"on..."
msgstr ""

#. ドッヒャァァァァァーーーーーーッ！！
msgctxt "0116 | NO NAME"
msgid "Ha-aaaaaahhhh!"
msgstr ""

#. あれには<CLT 3>“山田への合図”<CLT>という役割も
#. あったんじゃないのか？
msgctxt "0117 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "That was <CLT 3>to signal Hifumi<CLT>, wasn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. 『自分は予定通り３階までたどり着いた。
#. 　悲鳴を上げろ』…そんな意味の合図がな。
msgctxt "0118 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It was your way of telling him, \"We're on the 3rd\n"
"floor, everything's going according to plan.\""
msgstr ""

#. だからこそ、あんな校内全体に響き渡るような大声で
#. 叫んだんじゃないのか？
msgctxt "0119 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Why else would you let out a scream that could have\n"
"carried across the sea?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0120 | CELES"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. それに…怪しいのは、あの時もだよ…
msgctxt "0121 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I just realized another strange thing..."
msgstr ""

#. 保健室で、死んだフリをしてた山田クンを発見した時…
msgctxt "0122 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"When we found Hifumi in the nurse's office, who we now\n"
"know was only pretending to be dead..."
msgstr ""

#. まさか…予期していませんでしたわ…
msgctxt "0123 | CELES"
msgid "I certainly was not expecting this."
msgstr ""

#. あの山田クンが…
msgctxt "0124 | CELES"
msgid "I did not imagine that Hifumi..."
msgstr ""

#. 殺されてしまうなんて…！
msgctxt "0125 | CELES"
msgid "...would be murdered!"
msgstr ""

#. あの時、最初に<CLT 3>“殺された”<CLT>と言ったのは、
#. セレスさんだったよね…？
msgctxt "0126 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Celeste...you were the first one to say <CLT 3>he'd been\n"
"murdered<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. そうやって言う事で、山田クンは死んだんだと、
#. ボク達に思い込ませようとしたんじゃないの？
msgctxt "0127 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You wanted to make sure we wouldn't have any doubt in\n"
"our minds."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0128 | CELES"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. そ、そんな…信じらんないよ…
#. 全部…セレスちゃんの演技だったなんて…！
msgctxt "0129 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I-I don't believe it... Everything...the whole thing\n"
"was one big act!"
msgstr ""

#. …朝日奈さんは、山田クンの死体が消えた時、
#. セレスさんと一緒にいたんだよね？
msgctxt "0130 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Hina. You were with Celeste when Hifumi's body\n"
"disappeared, right?"
msgstr ""

#. うん…私の気分が悪かったから、
#. セレスちゃんがトイレに連れてってくれて…
msgctxt "0131 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Yeah... I was feeling kinda sick, so Celeste took me\n"
"to the bathroom..."
msgstr ""

#. …え！　じゃあ、あれも…！？
msgctxt "0132 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "...Wait! Then that was—!?"
msgstr ""

#. 朝日奈さんを気遣った訳じゃなくて、
#. 山田クンを保健室から逃がす隙を作る為だったのかも…
msgctxt "0133 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"She wasn't worried about you. She just saw a chance to\n"
"help Hifumi sneak out of the nurse's office."
msgstr ""

#. どれもこれも、１つずつでは小さな事だが、
#. 積み重なった途端、大きな疑惑になる…
msgctxt "0134 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Each piece isn't much by itself, but start putting\n"
"them together and the picture gets very ugly indeed."
msgstr ""

#. …そう思わないか、セレス？
msgctxt "0135 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Wouldn't you agree, Celeste?"
msgstr ""

#. さぁ、なんの事でしょう…？
msgctxt "0136 | CELES"
msgid "...I have no idea what you mean."
msgstr ""

#. とぼけても無駄だ…
msgctxt "0137 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Don't bother trying to deny it."
msgstr ""

#. お前は決定的な<CLT 3>ミス<CLT>を犯しているんだ。
msgctxt "0138 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "You made one fatal <CLT 3>mistake<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. …ミス？
msgctxt "0139 | CELES"
msgid "...Oh did I?"
msgstr ""

#. 最初にあれを聞いた時は、
#. さほど深刻には考えなかったが…
msgctxt "0140 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I didn't even catch it myself when you first said it,\n"
"but..."
msgstr ""

#. 今となっては、ハッキリと言える。
#. あれは、お前の犯した致命的なミスだとな。
msgctxt "0141 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"...looking back, I can say that that one little\n"
"slip-up was your undoing."
msgstr ""

#. なんの…事でしょう？
msgctxt "0142 | CELES"
msgid "Wh-What are you talking about...?"
msgstr ""

#. 山田の死体消失を聞いた俺達が、
#. 保健室に戻った直後の話だ…
msgctxt "0143 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I'm talking about what you said after Hifumi's body\n"
"disappeared and we returned to the nurse's office."
msgstr ""

#. まるで…楽しんでいるようですわね…
msgctxt "0144 | CELES"
msgid "They must really be enjoying this..."
msgstr ""

#. わたくし達が怯え、混乱するのを見て…
#. 楽しんでいるようですわ…
msgctxt "0145 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Enjoying the sight of us standing around, frightened\n"
"and confused..."
msgstr ""

#. このままだと…全員殺されてしまいます。
msgctxt "0146 | CELES"
msgid "We're all going to die here."
msgstr ""

#. 彼らのように…殺されてしまいます…
msgctxt "0147 | CELES"
msgid "We're going to die, just like those guys died..."
msgstr ""

#. その言葉なら我も聞いていたが…
#. それの何がおかしいと言うのだ？
msgctxt "0148 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I remember her saying that too, but...I don't\n"
"understand what's so strange about it."
msgstr ""

#. いいか、物理準備室で石丸の死体を発見したのは、
#. 俺と大神と腐川の３人だったんだ。
msgctxt "0149 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Then pay attention. Sakura, Toko, and I were first to\n"
"discover Taka's body in the equipment room."
msgstr ""

#. その後、遅れて来た苗木から山田殺害の件を聞き、
#. 俺と大神は、苗木と一緒に物理準備室を後にした…
msgctxt "0150 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Then Makoto showed up and told us Hifumi had been\n"
"killed. So Sakura and I left with Makoto."
msgstr ""

#. そして、廊下に出たところで、セレスと会い、
#. 俺達は４人で保健室に向かう事になったんだ。
msgctxt "0151 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Once we were in the hall, we ran into Celeste, and the\n"
"four of us headed to the nurse's office."
msgstr ""

#. その間、俺達は石丸の死については
#. 一切、何も話していないんだ。
msgctxt "0152 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Now, the entire time we were together, none of us said\n"
"anything about Taka being dead."
msgstr ""

#. そう考えると、セレスのあの<CLT 3>発言<CLT>は極めて不自然。
#. いや、不自然過ぎるんだよ。
msgctxt "0153 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Think about it—Celeste's <CLT 3>comment<CLT> doesn't make sense.\n"
"It was completely out of place."
msgstr ""

#. あの発言だの…不自然だの…
#. イマイチ意味がわからんのだけど…
msgctxt "0154 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I see what you're talking about. Although I\n"
"don't really get what it means..."
msgstr ""

#. おい、セレス。みんなが困ってるぞ。
#. みんなの為に、もう１度同じ発言をしてやれよ。
msgctxt "0155 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"You hear that, Celeste? Everyone's having some trouble\n"
"understanding. Could you repeat what you said?"
msgstr ""

#. お前が犯人じゃないなら、出来るはずだぞ？
msgctxt "0156 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If you're really not the culprit, you shouldn't have\n"
"any problem repeating it, right?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0157 | CELES"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>十神クンの言う、
#. セレスさんの発言の不自然な点…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0158 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Byakuya said that Celeste's comment doesn't make\n"
"sense...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それって…何を指しているんだ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0159 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But what is he alluding to...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
